job_description:
We are Yellow.

Since 2015, we’ve been creating fantastic software that accelerates our clients’ businesses. We combine the best talents and tools to develop custom web and mobile solutions for fast-growing startups and global companies in the USA and Europe.

Our projects got featured on TechCrunch, Esquire, TIME, The Week, Product Hunt.

Your tasks:

Part-time (on demand):

+ Presale activities with technical, PM and sales teams, update of estimation template, sign-off estimates;

+ Join client meetings to gather requirements, present AI capabilities, and answer technical questions;

+ Architecture of new AI solutions.

When full engagement:

+ Set up the best AI development practices and engineering processes across the AI Department;

+ Resolving technical challenges in ongoing development;

+ Participation in AI projects staffing; help to decide to keep requests in-house or outsource;

+ Research, experimentation, creation of proof-of-concepts; identifying primary domains for development.

Your experience:

+ Diverse and extensive experience in the Data Science/Machine Learning area (4+ years);

+ Proven experience starting new ML projects from scratch: from problem analysis and data collection to PoC and deployment to production;

+ Strong knowledge of ML algorithms, their limitations, and use cases;

+ Understanding of Generative AI and Prompt Engineering;

+ Confidence in Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, Matplotlib, SQL, etc;

+ Knowledge of and hands-on experience with ML/DL frameworks (PyTorch, TensorFlow, etc.);

+ Good level of English (strong B1 and above).

+ Excellent communication and leadership skills.

Your rewards

- Possibility to form and run AI/ML department;

- Professional development and growth;

- Possibility of fully remote work;

- Flexible work schedule;

- English classes with corporate teacher;

- Compensation of education;

- Relocation support;

- Corporate parties and activities (both online and offline);

- Gifts and bonuses for important events.

The process:

1. HR interview

2. Technical interview

Company overview:

We are:

65+ people working in 11 countries around the world

5-star rated company on Clutch

100+ completed projects

2+ million users of our apps

We are good at:

Web development

Mobile development (both native and cross-platform)

MVP development

UI/UX design

Cloud development

AI & ML

Areas we serve:

Chats and Social networks, Fintech, Travel, E-learning, Retail & E-commerce, Health & Fitness, Logistics and more.

Our culture

At Yellow we welcome people who are willing to learn, improve and create.

We encourage everyone to exchange ideas openly and make sure they are heard.

With our matrix company structure you can ask any person for help or advice – and you’ll get it! We help and support each other in every possible way, with the ultimate goal of establishing lasting relationships that bring joy and value.

Minimum bureaucracy and maximum creativity with no competitive atmosphere? This is Yellow!
